<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $42-3/8 (FIM 188.66).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $42-3/8 (FIM 188.66).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed $0-1/4 lower at $42-3/8 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 188.66 markka. In Helsinki on Thursday Nokia closed up 2.60 markka at 190.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) closed unchanged at $33-5/8 on Wall Street overnight. The price equals about 74.85 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 0.30 markka at 76.30 markka.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS closed flat at $21-3/8 in New York. The price equals about 95.17 markka. In Helsinki on Thursday, Rauma closed 0.40 markka higher at 96.90 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
